{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/extras/Story.gif?t=1753372876\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Twisted Screens</strong> invites you to step into the  boots of Tessa Gracelyn, a mercenary hired by ATR Industries to explore a long-abandoned science facility \u2014 one now overrun with horrifying experiments to shut down their nuclear reactor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teaming up with <strong>Legsy-0</strong>, a sarcastic A.I. assistant from ATR\u2019s golden age, you\u2019ll navigate the metal halls through a mix of parkour and puzzles. Legsy\u2019s sharp wit and questionable guidance will either help you survive. or make you go insane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1753372876\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this first-person sci-fi adventure inspired by the Mascot Horror genre, you\u2019ll leap, climb, and sprint through puzzle-filled environments, uncover absurd lore, and make use of strange gadgets to progress. The world is twisted, the humor is questionable. welcome to ATR Industries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3008950?t=1753372876","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753372876","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/c26391f4d85ead2cc0da39274e294ff3a9a64adf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753372876","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3008950/c26391f4d85ead2cc0da39274e294ff3a9a64adf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753372876","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2